h your reactions to the limit with challenges designed to develop real goalkeeping skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524820/extras/e073ca543d1d37f0db9a1323be663eff.poster.avif?t=1782386392\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524820/extras/e073ca543d1d37f0db9a1323be663eff.webm?t=1782386392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524820/extras/e073ca543d1d37f0db9a1323be663eff.mp4?t=1782386392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN A CLUB</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path and represent one of three clubs — Stanton United, Forgehill Rovers, or Waveport City — each with its own identity, stadium, and journey to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524820/extras/9fa242f8802b88650d6abb84ca26a1a5.poster.avif?t=1782386392\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524820/extras/9fa242f8802b88650d6abb84ca26a1a5.webm?t=1782386392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524820/extras/9fa242f8802b88650d6abb84ca26a1a5.mp4?t=1782386392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR CAREER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through competitive challenges, unlock new goalkeeper gear and stadium upgrades, earn trophies, and build your reputation as you progress from promising prospect to world-class shot stopper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid